# FRAMS Mobile Application - Environment Configuration
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your actual values

# Supabase Configuration (Required)
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key-here

# Notes:
# - Get these values from your Supabase project settings (Settings > API)
# - EXPO_PUBLIC_ prefix makes these variables available in the Expo app
# - Never commit the actual .env file to git
# - Use the same Supabase project as Face_Reco for data consistency
